{"id":"116e7c4b27a69d8e","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-horn-clause.md","title":"Horn Clause","display":"df-horn-clause — Horn Clause","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-horn-clause","aliases":["57-df-horn-clause"],"display":"df-horn-clause — Horn Clause","depends_on":["[[57-df-atomic-formula]]","[[57-df-universal-closure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-horn-clause"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-horn-clause</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-horn-clause — Horn Clause"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e38e198d11ebfafa\" href=\"?note=e38e198d11ebfafa\" title=\"57-df-atomic-formula\">57-df-atomic-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9f84d5a885cb119f\" href=\"?note=9f84d5a885cb119f\" title=\"57-df-universal-closure\">57-df-universal-closure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,B_i\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\">\\(A,B,B_i\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e38e198d11ebfafa\" href=\"?note=e38e198d11ebfafa\" title=\"57-df-atomic-formula\">57-df-atomic-formula</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{And},\\mathrm{UC}\">\\(\\mathrm{And},\\mathrm{UC}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9f84d5a885cb119f\" href=\"?note=9f84d5a885cb119f\" title=\"57-df-universal-closure\">57-df-universal-closure</a>。程序箭头 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leftarrow\">\\(\\leftarrow\\)</span> 是完整全称闭包的缩写，不是待另解释的关系符号。保留原 Horn 类只含一个正头的约定。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"B\\leftarrow B_1,\\ldots,B_n\\coloneqq\\mathrm{UC}(\\mathrm{And}(\\langle B_1,\\ldots,B_n\\rangle)\\to B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[B\\leftarrow B_1,\\ldots,B_n\\coloneqq\\mathrm{UC}(\\mathrm{And}(\\langle B_1,\\ldots,B_n\\rangle)\\to B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Horn}\\coloneqq\\{B\\leftarrow B_1,\\ldots,B_n:n\\in\\mathbb N\\land B\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\land(B_1,\\ldots,B_n)\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S^n\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Horn}\\coloneqq\\{B\\leftarrow B_1,\\ldots,B_n:n\\in\\mathbb N\\land B\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\land(B_1,\\ldots,B_n)\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S^n\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原定义的变量列和体长原先未绑定；现在按矩阵的所有自由变量取固定顺序闭包。空体通过 top 表示事实，原仅含正头的 Horn 约定保留。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-atomic-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e38e198d11ebfafa","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-atomic-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-universal-closure","status":"resolved","id":"9f84d5a885cb119f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-universal-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-atomic-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e38e198d11ebfafa","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A,B,B_i\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S$，见 [[57-df-atomic-formula]]；$n\\in\\mathbb N$。$\\mathrm{And},\\mathrm{UC}$ 见 [[57-df-universal-closure]]。程序箭头 $\\leftarrow$ 是完整全称闭包的缩写，不是待另解释的关系符号。保留原 Horn 类只含一个正头的约定。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-universal-closure","status":"resolved","id":"9f84d5a885cb119f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A,B,B_i\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S$，见 [[57-df-atomic-formula]]；$n\\in\\mathbb N$。$\\mathrm{And},\\mathrm{UC}$ 见 [[57-df-universal-closure]]。程序箭头 $\\leftarrow$ 是完整全称闭包的缩写，不是待另解释的关系符号。保留原 Horn 类只含一个正头的约定。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B,B_i\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{And},\\mathrm{UC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\leftarrow","display":false},{"tex":"B\\leftarrow B_1,\\ldots,B_n\\coloneqq\\mathrm{UC}(\\mathrm{And}(\\langle B_1,\\ldots,B_n\\rangle)\\to B).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Horn}\\coloneqq\\{B\\leftarrow B_1,\\ldots,B_n:n\\in\\mathbb N\\land B\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\land(B_1,\\ldots,B_n)\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S^n\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1026,"backlinks":[{"id":"c234c1cfaaa63dac","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Horn}$ 采用 [[57-df-horn-clause]] 的闭合正头子句，原子载体见 [[57-df-atomic-formula]]。$P$ 为候选子句集；$\\mathrm{DefProg}$ 同时保留类成员和一元谓词调用。原定义没有有限性限制，此处不添加。"},{"id":"20aaef29b45de654","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"931bc3d500f82dff","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$P\\in\\mathrm{DefProg}$，见 [[57-df-definite-program]]；子句矩阵 $A\\leftarrow B_1,\\ldots,B_n$ 见 [[57-df-horn-clause]]。限定这些矩阵原子均为关系应用，不含内建等号；$I\\subseteq B_S$，见 [[57-df-herbrand-base]]。$\\mathrm{GroundSubst}_S$、原子代换和 $\\mathrm{FV}$ 见 [[57-df-ground-substitution]]、[[57-df-substitution-application]]、[[57-df-free-variable]]。$\\mathrm{FV}(\\{A,B_1,\\ldots,B_n\\})$ 是矩阵变量，不是闭合子句的空自由变量集。"},{"id":"43bf0ac6633013d5","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$P\\in\\mathrm{DefProg}$，$G=(\\leftarrow A_1,\\ldots,A_k)\\in\\math